  "name": "Sense Alignment (Su)",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 1st level, at will, a cleric can, as a move action, concentrate on a single item or individual within 30 feet and determine what the alignment is, with a successful Sense Motive skill check. The DC for an item is equal to 10 + the caster level of the item. The DC for an individual is equal to 10 + the CR of the creature.</p>",
